    {
      "type": "callout",
      "variant": "tldr",
      "title": "目的とスコープ",
      "body": "在庫同期API v2は、全国12拠点の倉庫在庫を平均800msでリアルタイム同期し、二重販売を防止するための基盤である。本仕様の対象は同期API・イベント配信・整合性保証まで。決済処理と配送手配は対象外とする。"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<nav class=\"toc card-outlined\" aria-label=\"目次\"><p class=\"toc-title\">目次</p><ol class=\"toc-list\"><li class=\"toc-chapter\"><div class=\"toc-row\"><span class=\"toc-num\">01</span><span class=\"toc-label\">目的とスコープ</span><span class=\"toc-dots\"></span><span class=\"toc-page\">1</span></div></li><li class=\"toc-chapter\"><div class=\"toc-row\"><span class=\"toc-num\">02</span><span class=\"toc-label\">システムアーキテクチャ</span><span class=\"toc-dots\"></span><span class=\"toc-page\">2</span></div><ol class=\"toc-subs\"><li><div class=\"toc-row toc-sub\"><span class=\"toc-num\">2.1</span><span class=\"toc-label\">コンポーネント構成</span><span class=\"toc-dots\"></span><span class=\"toc-page\">2</span></div></li><li><div class=\"toc-row toc-sub\"><span class=\"toc-num\">2.2</span><span class=\"toc-label\">データフローと整合性</span><span class=\"toc-dots\"></span><span class=\"toc-page\">3</span></div></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-chapter\"><div class=\"toc-row\"><span class=\"toc-num\">03</span><span class=\"toc-label\">API仕様</span><span class=\"toc-dots\"></span><span class=\"toc-page\">4</span></div></li><li class=\"toc-chapter\"><div class=\"toc-row\"><span class=\"toc-num\">04</span><span class=\"toc-label\">リポジトリ構成</span><span class=\"toc-dots\"></span><span class=\"toc-page\">6</span></div></li><li class=\"toc-chapter\"><div class=\"toc-row\"><span class=\"toc-num\">05</span><span class=\"toc-label\">非機能要件</span><span class=\"toc-dots\"></span><span class=\"toc-page\">7</span></div></li><li class=\"toc-chapter\"><div class=\"toc-row\"><span class=\"toc-num\">06</span><span class=\"toc-label\">詳細設計</span><span class=\"toc-dots\"></span><span class=\"toc-page\">8</span></div></li><li class=\"toc-chapter\"><div class=\"toc-row\"><span class=\"toc-num\">07</span><span class=\"toc-label\">レビュー観点</span><span class=\"toc-dots\"></span><span class=\"toc-page\">10</span></div></li></ol></nav>",
