    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<figure class=\"api card-outlined\" aria-label=\"主要エンドポイント\"><figcaption class=\"api-title\">主要エンドポイント</figcaption><section class=\"api-ep\"><div class=\"api-head\"><span class=\"api-method -get\">GET</span><span class=\"api-path\">/v2/inventory/<span class=\"api-param\">:sku</span></span></div><p class=\"api-desc\">指定SKUの現在庫を全倉庫横断で集計して取得する。</p><table class=\"api-params\"><caption>Parameters</caption><thead><tr><th>name</th><th>type</th><th>required</th><th>description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"api-prow\"><td class=\"api-pn\">sku</td><td class=\"api-pt\">string</td><td><span class=\"api-req\">必須</span></td><td>対象の商品SKU（13桁JANコード）</td></tr><tr class=\"api-prow\"><td class=\"api-pn\">warehouse</td><td class=\"api-pt\">string</td><td><span class=\"api-opt\">任意</span></td><td>倉庫IDで絞り込む（省略時は全拠点合算）</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"api-res\"><span class=\"api-status -ok\">200</span><span class=\"api-rdesc\">倉庫別在庫と合計を含む在庫サマリJSONを返す。</span></div></section><section class=\"api-ep\"><div class=\"api-head\"><span class=\"api-method -post\">POST</span><span class=\"api-path\">/v2/inventory/sync</span></div><p class=\"api-desc\">在庫差分を登録し、全拠点へ同期イベントを発行する。</p><table class=\"api-params\"><caption>Parameters</caption><thead><tr><th>name</th><th>type</th><th>required</th><th>description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"api-prow\"><td class=\"api-pn\">sku</td><td class=\"api-pt\">string</td><td><span class=\"api-req\">必須</span></td><td>対象の商品SKU</td></tr><tr class=\"api-prow\"><td class=\"api-pn\">delta</td><td class=\"api-pt\">number</td><td><span class=\"api-req\">必須</span></td><td>在庫の増減数（マイナスで引当）</td></tr><tr class=\"api-prow\"><td class=\"api-pn\">reason</td><td class=\"api-pt\">string</td><td><span class=\"api-opt\">任意</span></td><td>在庫変動の理由コード（入荷/出荷/棚卸）</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"api-res\"><span class=\"api-status -warn\">400</span><span class=\"api-rdesc\">在庫が負になる場合はバリデーションエラーを返す。</span></div></section></figure>",
      "cssModules": [
        "api-endpoint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<figure class=\"ftr card-outlined\" aria-label=\"リポジトリ構成\"><figcaption class=\"ftr-title\">リポジトリ構成</figcaption><div class=\"ftr-tree\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"リポジトリ構成\"><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\"></span><span class=\"ftr-name -dir\">inventory-sync/</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># サービスルート</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">├─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name -dir\">cmd/</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># エントリポイント</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">│  └─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name\">server.go</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">├─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name -dir\">internal/</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># 非公開パッケージ</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">│  ├─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name -dir\">sync/</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># 同期オーケストレーション</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">│  │  ├─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name\">orchestrator.go</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">│  │  └─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name\">reconciler.go</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># 整合性照合</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">│  ├─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name -dir\">stock/</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># 在庫台帳ドメイン</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">│  │  └─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name\">ledger.go</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">│  └─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name -dir\">event/</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># Kafkaイベント発行</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">│     └─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name\">publisher.go</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">├─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name -dir\">api/</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># OpenAPI定義</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">│  └─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name\">openapi.yaml</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">├─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name -dir\">deploy/</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># k8sマニフェスト</span></div><div class=\"ftr-row\"><span class=\"ftr-guide\">└─ </span><span class=\"ftr-name\">README.md</span><span class=\"ftr-note\"># セットアップ手順</span></div></div></figure>",
      "cssModules": [
